      "text": "Nested Docker Project:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nested Docker Project:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ml0A4Wl9BLqdzWviOo4Io",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1695.7917686992669,
      "y": 149.42590499533804,
      "width": 778.4994506835938,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 114983543,
      "version": 374,
      "versionNonce": 1523360332,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783722427079,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- I need a docker-compose file that will spin\nup the otel-collector container, and the\ndocker:dind container, and a metrics\naggregator.\n- The docker:dind container will have the\nscript in it to run docker compose again\nwithin itself (after waiting for a moment)\n- The otel-collecter will export the metrics\non a certain port, which I need to expose\nfrom that container.\n- The metrics aggregator listens on that\nport for the telemetry info and listens for\nthe telemetry info of the container beneath\nit.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- I need a docker-compose file that will spin up the otel-collector container, and the docker:dind container, and a metrics aggregator.\n- The docker:dind container will have the script in it to run docker compose again within itself (after waiting for a moment)\n- The otel-collecter will export the metrics on a certain port, which I need to expose from that container.\n- The metrics aggregator listens on that port for the telemetry info and listens for the telemetry info of the container beneath it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ip5oOoZj-cGACHjmkwYhj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1483.8921870726863,
      "y": 1166.084306835626,
      "width": 1160.135498046875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1428531481,
      "version": 436,
      "versionNonce": 556785868,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783722342137,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Metrics Aggregator:\n- listens for a list of metrics objects from the nested aggregator\n- listens for the metrics object from the otel collector\n- maintains a current value for each level's metrics\n- listens to requests for the current value of each level's metrics",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Metrics Aggregator:\n- listens for a list of metrics objects from the nested aggregator\n- listens for the metrics object from the otel collector\n- maintains a current value for each level's metrics\n- listens to requests for the current value of each level's metrics",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
